+	/*
+	 * DTBO overlay stub nodes.
+	 *
+	 * LK applies the vendor's odmdtbo overlay (entry 2 of 13) on top of this
+	 * DTB before starting the kernel. That overlay resolves its targets by
+	 * SYMBOL NAME through /__symbols__ (see its /__fixups__ node), so every
+	 * symbol it references must exist here or the overlay fails and LK
+	 * refuses to boot at all ("boot image dtb_overlay fail").
+	 *
+	 * These are deliberately inert: nothing in mainline matches
+	 * "oppo,a3-dtbo-stub" and they are disabled, so the overlay's content
+	 * lands on nodes the kernel ignores. They exist purely to make the
+	 * overlay applicable.
+	 *
+	 * Generated from dtbo entry 2 __fixups__ -- regenerate if the overlay
+	 * ever changes.
+	 */
